# Mode ABI: the SAME query the model's own `log_likelihood` binding scores, with
# the nominal point's record fields opened up as ABI inputs so the frozen point
# grid can drive it. Every name is already a free `elementof` boundary in the
# model, so the query only names the ABI. The record's field order is the
# model's own, unchanged.
lp = logdensityof(likelihood, record(syst1 = syst1, mu = mu, syst2 = syst2, mcstat = mcstat, syst3 = syst3))
inputs = (mu, syst1, syst2, syst3, mcstat)
outputs = (lp)
